{
 "help": "usage: wgsextract vcf deepvariant [-h] [-r REGION] [--wes] [--ont] [--pacbio] [--gpu]\n                                  [--reference-evidence {none,gvcf}] [--force] [--force-step STEP]\n                                  [--dry-run] [--help-all]\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  -r, --region REGION   Chromosomal region (e.g. chrM)\n  --wes                 Set model type to WES (default: WGS)\n  --ont                 Alias for --model-type ONT_R104 (R10.4.1 only; x86-64).\n  --pacbio              Alias for --model-type PACBIO.\n  --gpu                 NVIDIA GPU (x86-64 Linux): WGS/ONT via wgse-deepvariant if set up, else\n                        Parabricks; Ultima: Google's GPU image (docs/hardware.md#nvidia-gpus-\n                        parabricks).\n  --reference-evidence {none,gvcf}\n                        Also write reference evidence: a gVCF, deepvariant.g.vcf.gz (+ .tbi),\n                        beside the unchanged variant VCF (gvcf; costs ~5 percent more time, ~25\n                        with Parabricks), or not (none). Default: config reference_evidence, else\n                        none.\n  --help-all            Show this help with the advanced options too, and exit.\n\nglobal options:\n  -i/--input, -o/--outdir, --genome, --ref, -t/--threads, -m/--memory, --json, --quiet, --debug,\n  --config and the other global options are accepted before or after the command; 'wgsextract\n  --help' lists them all.\n\nresuming:\n  Completed steps are recorded in <output>.steps.json and skipped when a rerun's inputs,\n  settings and tools are unchanged.\n\n  --force, --no-resume  Rerun every step, ignoring the steps an earlier run completed.\n  --force-step STEP     Rerun STEP and the steps that use its outputs (repeatable). Steps:\n                        stage_reads, make_examples, call_variants, postprocess_variants.\n  --dry-run             Print which steps would run or be skipped, and why, then exit.\n\n6 advanced options not shown; 'wgsextract vcf deepvariant --help-all' lists them.\n\nexamples:\n  wgsextract vcf deepvariant --input sample.cram\n  wgsextract vcf deepvariant --input hifi.bam --pacbio\n  wgsextract vcf deepvariant --input sample.cram --force-step call_variants\n\noutputs (in the output directory unless noted):\n  deepvariant.vcf.gz (+ .tbi) and deepvariant.vcf.gz.steps.json; with\n  --reference-evidence gvcf also deepvariant.g.vcf.gz (+ .tbi); until it\n  finishes, the stages' work in .deepvariant.work, where a rerun resumes.\n\nneeds:\n  samtools, tabix; depending on options and inputs, also: bcftools, docker,\n  run_deepvariant, wgse-deepvariant, sambamba; hours on a 30x genome.\n",
